title: "interpretable-dss-cancer"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying the doctoral thesis "Interpretable Decision Support Systems
  for Early Cancer Diagnosis and Personalized Treatment": NObSP interpretability,
  population-scale gastric cancer risk prediction, and MPC-based adaptive therapy
  for metastatic castration-resistant prostate cancer.
